    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1240-a5">

                <pb facs="0997" n="881" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg881"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chief Inspector to the
                            representative of the Cortez Oil
                        Corporation</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 56.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tampico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 9, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In reply to your note dated the 8th
                    instant requesting explanation of my notes Nos. 52 and 43 of the 6th and 3d
                    instant respectively, I inform you that the permission conceded to you is valid
                    only until new petroleum laws are issued, and after that date you may continue
                    your works in accordance with the provisions of those laws.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">F. Cabrera.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
